            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l18.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">18:</span></span>
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> Definition of minimum and maximum number of subnets (<math id="alg1.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{NS}_{l},{NS}_{u}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{NS}_{l},{NS}_{u}</annotation></semantics></math>), the minimum and maximum number of hosts in the network (<math id="alg1.l18.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{NH}_{l},{NH}_{u}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{NH}_{l},{NH}_{u}</annotation></semantics></math>), a default set of subnets (<math id="alg1.l18.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{S\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{S\}</annotation></semantics></math>) the actions associated with the red, blue and green agents (<math id="alg1.l18.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{R},a_{B},a_{G}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>G</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{R},a_{B},a_{G}</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l19.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">19:</span></span>
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> The generated network topology <math id="alg1.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{G}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{G}</annotation></semantics></math> – comprised of a set of subnets (<math id="alg1.l19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{S\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{S\}</annotation></semantics></math>), a set of hosts (<math id="alg1.l19.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{H\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{H\}</annotation></semantics></math>), and a set of agents (<math id="alg1.l19.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{A\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{A\}</annotation></semantics></math>).

</div>
